{% comment %}
  OVERRIDE locale di al_folio_core/_includes/metadata.liquid (v1.0.15). Differenze dall'originale:
  campi SEO opzionali nel front matter, gestiti dall'admin (vedi admin/claude.md sez. 0d):
    seo_title       -> testo del <title>. Se vuoto: comportamento originale ("<title pagina> | <titolo sito>").
    seo_description -> meta description. Se vuota: prima "description" (originale), poi un estratto
                       automatico del testo (150 caratteri), poi la description del sito.
  NON usare "description" per la SEO: in al-folio e' anche il sottotitolo VISIBILE nella pagina.
  Le variabili seo_ttl / seo_desc sotto sono usate in <title>, meta description, OpenGraph, Twitter e schema.org.
  SECONDA differenza dall'originale (in FONDO al file): aggancio moduli "head", una riga
  (include di modules_hook.liquid con hook='head'). Funziona perche' head.liquid della gem include questo file
  DENTRO <head> [DEDOTTO dalla gem al_folio_core-1.0.15, _includes/head.liquid riga 2 "include metadata.liquid";
  NON documentato: se un aggiornamento della gem sposta o toglie quell'include, i moduli con hook "head" smettono
  di caricare CSS/JS senza errori]. Vedi _includes/modules_hook.liquid e admin/claude.md sez. 11.
  TERZA differenza dall'originale (SEO strutturato, CLAUDE.md punto 15): (a) variabili seo_canonical/is_post/is_service (il canonical lo emette GIA' head.liquid della gem: NON aggiungerne un secondo);
  (b) og:type/twitter:card/og:locale corretti; (c) schema.org riscritto come un solo @graph (Organization, WebSite, Service/BlogPosting/WebPage,
  BreadcrumbList) con dati da _config.yml > schema_org. Il generatore sameAs originale e' stato TOLTO: leggeva _data/socials.yml, ancora quello del
  template (profili di Einstein). Controllo dopo ogni build: python verifica_seo.py --build <cartella _site>.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign seo_desc = page.seo_description %}
{% if seo_desc == null or seo_desc == '' %}{% assign seo_desc = page.description %}{% endif %}
{% if seo_desc == null or seo_desc == '' %}
  {% comment %}
    L'estratto automatico si fa SOLO se il sorgente non contiene codice Liquid (tag graffa-percento o
    doppia graffa). Pagine come /blog/ sono template: il loro page.content e' codice, non testo, e
    finirebbe nella meta description (bug reale visto online sulla pagina blog). In quel caso si passa
    al fallback del sito.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% assign has_liquid = false %}
  {% if page.content contains '{%' or page.content contains '{{' %}{% assign has_liquid = true %}{% endif %}
  {% if page.content and page.content != '' and has_liquid == false %}
    {% comment %}
      L'estratto parte dal markdown GREZZO (page.content non e' ancora HTML in questo punto): tolgo i
      simboli markdown piu' comuni (* _ # ` > [ ]). LIMITE NOTO: Liquid non ha regex, quindi la parte
      "(url)" di un link [testo](url) resta nel testo. Se la prima frase di una pagina e' un link,
      l'estratto sara' brutto: in quel caso compilare seo_description a mano (e' per questo che esiste).
    {% endcomment %}
    {% assign seo_desc = page.content | strip_html | replace: '[', '' | replace: ']', '' | replace: '*', '' | replace: '_', ' ' | replace: '#', '' | replace: '`', '' | replace: '>', '' %}
    {% comment %} normalize_whitespace trasforma a-capo e spazi multipli in UNO spazio. NON usare strip_newlines qui: toglie l'a-capo senza mettere spazio e incolla le parole ("IntroQuesto"). {% endcomment %}
    {% assign seo_desc = seo_desc | normalize_whitespace | strip | truncate: 155 %}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if seo_desc == null or seo_desc == '' %}{% assign seo_desc = site.description %}{% endif %}
{% assign seo_desc = seo_desc | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | escape %}
{% assign seo_ttl = page.seo_title %}
{% if seo_ttl %}{% assign seo_ttl = seo_ttl | replace: '{title}', site.title %}{% endif %}

{% if site.enable_google_verification or site.enable_bing_verification %}
  <!-- Website verification -->
  {% if site.enable_google_verification %}
    <meta name="google-site-verification" content="{{ site.google_site_verification }}">
  {% endif %}
  {% if site.enable_bing_verification %}
    <meta name="msvalidate.01" content="{{ site.bing_site_verification }}">
  {% endif %}
  <!--
    Avoid warning on Google Chrome Error with Permissions-Policy header:
    Origin trial controlled feature not enabled: 'interest-cohort'.
    see https://stackoverflow.com/a/75119417
  -->
  <meta http-equiv="Permissions-Policy" content="interest-cohort=()">
{% endif %}

{% capture author_name %}{% if site.title and site.title != 'blank' %}{{ site.title }}{% else %}{{ site.first_name }}{% if site.middle_name %} {{ site.middle_name }}{% endif %} {{ site.last_name }}{% endif %}{% endcapture %}

<!-- Standard metadata -->
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<title>
  {% if site.title == 'blank' %}
    {% capture title %}{{ author_name }}{% endcapture %}
  {% else %}
    {% capture title %}{{ site.title }}{% endcapture %}
  {% endif %}
  {% if seo_ttl and seo_ttl != '' %}
    {{ seo_ttl | escape }}
  {% elsif page.url == '/blog/index.html' %}
    {{ page.title }} | {{ title }}
  {% elsif page.title != 'blank' and page.url != '/' %}
    {% if page.title == null or page.title == '' %}
      {{ page.date | date: '%Y' }} | {{ title }}
    {% else %}
      {{ page.title }} | {{ title }}
    {% endif %}
  {% else %}
    {{ title }}
  {% endif %}
</title>
<meta name="author" content="{{ author_name }}">
<meta name="description" content="{{ seo_desc }}">
{% comment %} SEO strutturato: variabili usate da OpenGraph e schema.org (il canonical lo emette head.liquid della gem). Nessun URL scritto qui: la sezione (es. /servizi/) viene da permalink_per_categoria in _config.yml. {% endcomment %}
{% assign seo_canonical = page.url | absolute_url | remove_first: 'index.html' %}
{% assign is_post = false %}
{% if page.collection == 'posts' %}{% assign is_post = true %}{% endif %}
{% comment %} I servizi sono la collection 'servizi' (non piu' post con categoria): is_service = pagina di quella collection. {% endcomment %}
{% assign is_service = false %}
{% if page.collection == 'servizi' %}{% assign is_service = true %}{% endif %}
{% assign seo_section = '' %}
{% assign seo_section_url = '' %}
{% if is_service %}
  {% assign seo_section = 'Servizi' %}
  {% assign seo_section_url = '/servizi/' | absolute_url %}
{% elsif is_post %}
  {% assign seo_cat = page.categories | first %}
  {% assign seo_rule = site.permalink_per_categoria[seo_cat] %}
  {% if seo_rule %}
    {% assign seo_section = seo_cat | capitalize %}
    {% assign seo_section_url = seo_rule | remove: ':title/' | absolute_url %}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if page.keywords or site.keywords %}
  <meta name="keywords" content="{% if page.keywords %}{{ page.keywords }}{% else %}{{ site.keywords }}{% endif %}">
{% endif %}

{% assign is_blog_post = false %}
{% if page.url != '/blog/index.html' and page.url contains '/blog/' %}
  {% unless page.url contains '/tag/' or page.url contains '/category/' %}
    {% assign is_blog_post = true %}
  {% endunless %}
{% endif %}

{% if site.serve_og_meta %}
  <!-- OpenGraph -->
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ title }}">
  <meta property="og:type" content="{% if is_post and is_service == false %}article{% else %}website{% endif %}">
  <meta property="og:title" content="{% if seo_ttl and seo_ttl != '' %}{{ seo_ttl | escape }}{% elsif page.title %}{{ title | strip }} | {{ page.title }}{% else %}{{ title | strip }}{% endif %}">
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{ page.url | prepend: site.baseurl | prepend: site.url | remove_first: 'index.html' }}">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{ seo_desc }}">
  {% if page.og_image or site.og_image %}
    {% assign og_image_source = page.og_image | default: site.og_image %}
    {% if og_image_source contains '://' %}
      {% assign og_image_url = og_image_source %}
    {% else %}
      {% assign og_image_url = og_image_source | prepend: site.baseurl | prepend: site.url %}
    {% endif %}
    <meta property="og:image" content="{{ og_image_url }}">
  {% endif %}
  <meta property="og:locale" content="{% if site.lang == 'it' %}it_IT{% elsif site.lang == 'en' %}en_US{% else %}{{ site.lang }}{% endif %}">
  {% if is_post %}
    <meta property="article:published_time" content="{{ page.date | date_to_xmlschema }}">
  {% endif %}

  <!-- Twitter card -->
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="{% if page.og_image or site.og_image %}summary_large_image{% else %}summary{% endif %}">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="{% if seo_ttl and seo_ttl != '' %}{{ seo_ttl | escape }}{% elsif page.title %}{{ page.title }}{% else %}{{ title }}{% endif %}">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ seo_desc }}">
  {% if page.og_image or site.og_image %}
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="{{ og_image_url }}">
  {% endif %}
  {% if site.x_username %}
    <meta name="twitter:site" content="@{{ site.x_username }}">
    <meta name="twitter:creator" content="@{{ site.x_username }}">
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if site.serve_schema_org %}
  <!-- Schema.org -->
  {% comment %}
    Un solo @graph. Dati azienda SOLO da _config.yml > schema_org; i campi vuoti NON vengono emessi (niente dati inventati).
    Nodi: Organization + WebSite (su ogni pagina, @id fissi); poi UNO tra Service (pagine della collection 'servizi', is_service: NON dipende dalla categoria; se cambi la collection aggiorna is_service qui sopra),
    BlogPosting (altri post) e WebPage; poi BreadcrumbList (non in home). Ordine dei campi: prima gli opzionali (con virgola
    finale), per ultimi quelli sempre presenti: cosi' il JSON resta valido qualunque campo sia vuoto.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% assign so = site.schema_org %}
  {% assign ld_root = '/' | absolute_url %}
  {% assign ld_org_name = so.name | default: title | strip %}
  {% assign ld_org_id = ld_root | append: '#organization' %}
  {% assign ld_site_id = ld_root | append: '#website' %}
  {% assign ld_desc = seo_desc | replace: '&amp;', '&' | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' %}
  {% assign ld_name = page.title %}
  {% if ld_name == nil or ld_name == '' or ld_name == 'blank' %}{% assign ld_name = ld_org_name %}{% endif %}
  {% assign ld_org_type = so.type %}
  {% if ld_org_type == nil or ld_org_type == '' %}
    {% if so.street %}{% assign ld_org_type = 'LocalBusiness' %}{% else %}{% assign ld_org_type = 'Organization' %}{% endif %}
  {% endif %}
  {% assign ld_logo = so.logo %}
  {% if ld_logo %}{% unless ld_logo contains '://' %}{% assign ld_logo = ld_logo | absolute_url %}{% endunless %}{% endif %}
  {% assign ld_img = page.og_image | default: site.og_image %}
  {% if ld_img %}{% unless ld_img contains '://' %}{% assign ld_img = ld_img | absolute_url %}{% endunless %}{% endif %}

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        {% if ld_logo %}"logo": {{ ld_logo | jsonify }},{% endif %}
        {% if so.telephone %}"telephone": {{ so.telephone | jsonify }},{% endif %}
        {% if so.email %}"email": {{ so.email | jsonify }},{% endif %}
        {% if so.street or so.city or so.postal_code %}
        "address": {
          {% if so.street %}"streetAddress": {{ so.street | jsonify }},{% endif %}
          {% if so.city %}"addressLocality": {{ so.city | jsonify }},{% endif %}
          {% if so.region %}"addressRegion": {{ so.region | jsonify }},{% endif %}
          {% if so.postal_code %}"postalCode": {{ so.postal_code | jsonify }},{% endif %}
          {% if so.country %}"addressCountry": {{ so.country | jsonify }},{% endif %}
          "@type": "PostalAddress"
        },
        {% endif %}
        {% if so.area_served %}"areaServed": {{ so.area_served | jsonify }},{% endif %}
        {% if so.same_as and so.same_as.size > 0 %}"sameAs": {{ so.same_as | jsonify }},{% endif %}
        "@type": {{ ld_org_type | jsonify }},
        "@id": {{ ld_org_id | jsonify }},
        "name": {{ ld_org_name | jsonify }},
        "url": {{ ld_root | jsonify }}
      },
      {
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "@id": {{ ld_site_id | jsonify }},
        "url": {{ ld_root | jsonify }},
        "name": {{ ld_org_name | jsonify }},
        "inLanguage": {{ site.lang | default: 'it' | jsonify }},
        "publisher": { "@id": {{ ld_org_id | jsonify }} }
      },
      {% if is_service %}
      {
        {% if so.area_served %}"areaServed": {{ so.area_served | jsonify }},{% endif %}
        "@type": "Service",
        "@id": {{ seo_canonical | append: '#service' | jsonify }},
        "name": {{ ld_name | jsonify }},
        "serviceType": {{ ld_name | jsonify }},
        "description": {{ ld_desc | jsonify }},
        "url": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }},
        "mainEntityOfPage": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }},
        "provider": { "@id": {{ ld_org_id | jsonify }} }
      }
      {% elsif is_post %}
      {
        {% if ld_img %}"image": {{ ld_img | jsonify }},{% endif %}
        "@type": "BlogPosting",
        "@id": {{ seo_canonical | append: '#article' | jsonify }},
        "headline": {{ ld_name | jsonify }},
        "description": {{ ld_desc | jsonify }},
        "url": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }},
        "mainEntityOfPage": { "@type": "WebPage", "@id": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }} },
        "datePublished": {{ page.date | date_to_xmlschema | jsonify }},
        "dateModified": {{ page.last_modified_at | default: page.date | date_to_xmlschema | jsonify }},
        "inLanguage": {{ site.lang | default: 'it' | jsonify }},
        "author": { "@id": {{ ld_org_id | jsonify }} },
        "publisher": { "@id": {{ ld_org_id | jsonify }} }
      }
      {% else %}
      {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": {{ seo_canonical | append: '#webpage' | jsonify }},
        "url": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }},
        "name": {{ ld_name | jsonify }},
        "description": {{ ld_desc | jsonify }},
        "inLanguage": {{ site.lang | default: 'it' | jsonify }},
        "isPartOf": { "@id": {{ ld_site_id | jsonify }} }
      }
      {% endif %}
      {% if page.url != '/' and page.url != '/index.html' %}
      ,{
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "@id": {{ seo_canonical | append: '#breadcrumb' | jsonify }},
        "itemListElement": [
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": {{ ld_root | jsonify }} },
          {% if seo_section != '' %}
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": {{ seo_section | jsonify }}, "item": {{ seo_section_url | jsonify }} },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": {{ ld_name | jsonify }}, "item": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }} }
          {% elsif is_post %}
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blog", "item": {{ '/blog/' | absolute_url | jsonify }} },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": {{ ld_name | jsonify }}, "item": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }} }
          {% else %}
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": {{ ld_name | jsonify }}, "item": {{ seo_canonical | jsonify }} }
          {% endif %}
        ]
      }
      {% endif %}
    ]
  }
  </script>
{% endif %}

{% comment %} MODULI: aggancio 'head' (CSS/JS dei moduli attivi). Vedi modules_hook.liquid. Se togli questa riga i moduli con hook head non caricano piu' nulla. {% endcomment %}
{% include modules_hook.liquid hook='head' %}
